<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="1TH" style="id">1 Thesalonika</book>
  <para style="h">1 Thesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Thesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Thesalonika</para>
  <para style="mt">1 Thesalonika</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pawl, Silvanus hoi Timote mah aicae Ampa Sithaw hoi Angraeng Jesu Kri ah kaom Thessalonika vangpui ih kricaabunawk khaeah hae tiah thuih pae: aicae Ampa Sithaw, Angraeng Jesu Kri khae hoi ih tahmenhaih hoi monghaih to nangcae khaeah om nasoe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lawk ka thuih o naah, nangcae boih han kawnhaih lawk ka thuih o toepsoep;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />aicae Ampa Sithaw hmaa ah tanghaih hoiah toksakhaih, amlunghaih hoiah tha pathokhaih, aicae Angraeng Jesu Kri oephaih hoiah pauephaih to boeng ai ah lawk ka thuih o;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />palung ih nawkamyanawk, nangcae loe Sithaw mah ni ang qoih o, tiah ka panoek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kaicae ih tamthanglok hoih loe nangcae khaeah lok hoi khue ah angzo ai, toe thacakhaih, Kacai Muithla hoi loktang panoekhaih hoiah ni angzoh, nangcae khae ka oh o naah kaicae kawbangmaw kho ka sak o, tito na panoek o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kating ai pacaekthlaekhaih na tong o cadoeh, Kacai Muithla anghoehaih hoiah tamthanglok to na talawk o pongah, kaicae hnukbang kami hoi Angraeng hnukbang kami ah na oh o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />To tiah nangcae loe Macedonia hoi Akaia prae ah kaom tangcaanawk mah khet koi kaom ah na oh o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nangcae khae hoi thuih ih Angraeng ih tamthanglok loe, Macedonia hoi Akaia prae thung khue ah na ai, Sithaw na tang o haih tamthang loe ahmuen kruekah amsong boeh; to pongah tidoeh thuih han angaih ai boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kaicae loe kawbangmaw nangcae thungah ka kun o, tito angmacae mah roe a thuih o, kahing hoi loktang Sithaw ih tok to sak hanah krang bokhaih to na toengh o sut moe, Sithaw khaeah nang qoi o boeh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />angzo han koi Sithaw palungphuihaih thung hoiah aicae loisakkung, duekhaih thung hoiah Anih mah pathawk ih a Capa Jesu van hoiah angzo tih, tiah na zing o haih kawng doeh a thuih o.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nawkamyanawk, nangcae khaeah kang zoh o haih hae, azom na ai ni, tiah na panoek o:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />na panoek o baktih toengah, kaicae loe Filipi ah ang pacaekthlaek o moe, azat kaom ah ang sak o, toe paroeai angaekhaih hoiah nangcae khaeah kahoih tamthanglok to Sithaw ah misahoihaih hoiah ka thuih o thaih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kaicae loe sakpazaehaih, ciimcai ai ah toksakhaih hoi alinghaih hoiah nangcae to tha kang paek o ai:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />tamthanglok hoih pakuem hanah oepthok kami ah Sithaw mah tapom baktih toengah, kami koehhaih baktih na ai ah, Sithaw koehhaih baktiah ni ka thuih o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na panoek o baktih toengah, kaicae loe amoekhaih lok ka thui o ai, kamthlai koeh hmoekhaih lok doeh ka thui o vai ai, tito Sithaw mah panoek:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kri mah patoeh ih kami ah ka oh o pongah, thoemto nangcae hanah loe hmuenzit ah doeh ka oh o thaih, toe kami pakoehhaih to ka pakrong o ai, nangcae mah pakoehhaih doeh ka pakrong o ai, kalah kaminawk mah pakoehhaih doeh ka pkrong o ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amno mah a caanawk pacah baktih toengah, nangcae salakah ka oh o naah, poeknaemhaih hoiah ni kho ka sak o:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />kang palung o parai pongah, Sithaw ih tamthanglok hoih thuih han ih khue na ai ah, nangcae palung kang nat o haih pongah, hinghaih paek han khoek to mataeng doeh ka koeh o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nang panoek o baktih toengah, nawkamyanawk, kaicae loe angpho qawthaih hoiah ni tok ka sak o: nangcae raihaih paek han ai ah aqum athun tok ka sak o moe, nangcae khaeah kahoih Sithaw tamthanglok to kang thuih o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nang panoek o baktih toengah, nangcae tangcaanawk khaeah loe, coek koi kaom ai ciimhaih hoi toenghaih hoiah ni kho ka sak o, tito Sithaw mah doeh panoek:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />ampa mah a caanawk khaeah sak ih baktih toengah, nangcae boih khaeah kawbangmaw thapaekhaih hoi monghaih lok kang thuih o, tito na panoek o,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Siangpahrang ah a uk ih prae hoi lensawkhaih thungah nangcae kawkkung, Sithaw mikcuk naakrak ah kho na sak o thai hanah lok kang thuih o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kaicae khae hoi Sithaw lok na thaih o naah, kaminawk ih lok baktiah na talawk o ai, loktang, Sithaw ih lok baktiah ni na talawk o, nangcae tangcaanawk salakah tok ka sak o pongah, Sithaw khaeah boeng ai ah anghoehaih lawk ka thuih o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nawkamyanawk, nangcae loe Judah prae ah Kri Jesu to talawk moe, Sithaw hnukbang kricaabunawk mah, Judah kaminawk khae hoi pacaekthlaekhaih tongh o baktih toengah, nangcae doeh nangmacae kaminawk khae hoi ih pacaekthlaekhaih to na tongh o toeng:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Judahnawk mah Angraeng Jesu Kri hoi angmacae ih tahmaanawk to hum o, kaicae doeh ang pacaekthlaek o; nihcae mah Sithaw palung anghoe o sak thai ai, nihcae loe kami boih ih misa ah oh o:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Gentelnawk mah pahlonghaih hnu o moeng tih, tiah a poek o pongah nihcae khaeah kahoih tamthanglok taphong hanah kaicae to ang pakaa o, to tiah angmacae zaehaih to koi o sak: to pongah hnukkhuem ah Sithaw palungphuihaih to nihcae nuiah krah tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Toe nawkamyanawk, kaicae loe palung hoi na ai, taksa ah nangcae hoi nawnetta thung angthla ah ka oh o, nangcae kang poek o parai pongah, hnuk han kang koeh o parai boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />To pongah nangcae khae angzoh han ka koeh o, kai, Pawl doeh nangcae khae angzoh pacoengah, angzoh let han ka koeh vop, toe Setan mah kaicae to pakaa ving.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aicae Angraeng Jesu Kri anghum naah angmah hmaa ah, nangcae ai ah loe mi maw ka oep o ih anghoehaih hoi anghoehaih sui lumuek ah kaom?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nangcae loe kaicae lensawkhaih hoi anghoehaih ah na oh o.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />To pongah ka pauep o thai ai naah loe, Athen vangpui ah kaimacae bueng oh nahaeloe hoi tih mue, tiah ka poek o;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />nangcae to kang cak o sak moe, na tang o haih kawng pongah thapaekhaih lok thuih hanah, Sithaw toksah kami, Kri tamthanglok hoih taphonghaih bangah toksah ampui, kaicae ih amnawk ah kaom, Timote to nangcae khaeah kang patoeh o:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />hae baktih patanghaih pongah, mi doeh poek amkhraih han om ai: hae tiah patang han ih ni aicae hanah tok ang paek, tito nangmacae mah roe na panoek o boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Raihaih a tong o tih, tiah nangcae hoi nawnto ka oh o naah kang thuih o coek boeh; ka thuih o ih lok baktiah oh tangtang, tito na panoek o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pacuekkung mah na pacuek o ueloe, patanghaih hoiah ka sak o ih tok to azom pui ah om moeng tih, tiah ka poek pongah, ka pauep thai ai naah nangcae tanghaih panoek hanah Timote to ka patoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Toe Timote loe vaihi nangcae khae hoi amlaem let boeh, nangcae tanghaih hoi amlunghaih, kaicae nang pahnet o ai, tiah tamthang kahoih to ang sinh; nangcae hnuk han ka koeh o baktih toengah, nangcae mah doeh kaicae hnuk han na koeh o toeng, tiah ang thuih:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />to pongah nawkamyanawk, kam tang o moe, raihaih ka tongh o naah, nangcae tanghaih rang hoiah poek monghaih ka tawnh o:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Angraeng ah kacakah nang doet o nahaeloe, vaihi kaicae han hinghaih ah oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nangcae mah aicae Sithaw hmaa ah kaicae han anghoehaih nang paek o pongah, nangcae han kawkruk maw Sithaw khaeah kawnhaih lawk ka thuih o han oh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nangcae ih krang ka hnuk o moe, tanghaih bangah kangaih hmuen ka koep o sak thai hanah, aqum athun kamthlai ah lawk ka thuih o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aicae Ampa Sithaw angmah hoi aicae Angraeng Jesu mah, nangcae khae kang zoh o thai hanah lam patuek nasoe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nangcae khae ka sak o ih baktih toengah, nangcae mah doeh maeto hoi maeto amlunghaih pung moe, kami boih amlunghaih hoiah akoep o thai hanah, Angraeng mah qoengsak nasoe:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />angmah ih kaciim kaminawk hoi nawnto aicae Angraeng Jesu angzoh naah, Anih mah aicae Ampa Sithaw hmaa ah coek koi kaom ai kaciim poekhaih hoiah omsak tih.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nawkamyanawk, kawbangmaw hing moe, Sithaw koehhaih baktiah khosak han, tiah kaicae khae hoi nam tuk o baktih toengah, to tiah kho na sak o thaih aep hanah, Angraeng Jesu rang hoiah thapaekhaih lok kang thuih o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Angraeng Jesu rang hoiah kawbaktih kaalok maw kang paek o, tito na panoek o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ciimcai ah khosak moe, zu sava laep ah nongpa nongpata zae sakhaih ayae hae Sithaw koehhaih ah oh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />nangcae boih mah, angmah ih laom to kawbangmaw pakoeh moe, ciimsak han, tito panoek han oh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sithaw panoek ai Gentelnawk baktiah taksa koehhaih to na patom o han om ai:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />hae hmuen pongah mi kawbaktih mah doeh angmah ih nawkamya nuiah kasae hmuen sah hmah nasoe: Angraeng loe to baktih kasae hmuen sah kaminawk nuiah lu lakung ah oh, to pongah thaisakhaih lok kang thuih o coek boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amhnongsak hanah Sithaw mah aicae hae kawk ai, ciimcai han ih ni kawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />To pongah kami maeto khet patoekhaih tawn kami loe, anih mah kami to khet patoek ai, aicae han Angmah ih Kacai Muithla paekkung, Sithaw to ni patoek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Toe nangcae khaeah loe nawkamya amlunghaih kawng to ka tarik han angaih ai: maeto hoi maeto amlung hanah Sithaw angmah roe ang patuk o boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Macedonia prae boih ah kaom nawkamyanawk khaeah to tiah na sak o: toe nawkamyanawk, pop aep aep ah na sak o thai hanah kang pacae o;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />kang thuih o ih baktih toengah, kamdueng rue ah khosah oh, nangmacae ih tok to sah oh, nangmacae ban hoiah tok to sah oh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />to tiah ni tasa bang ih kaminawk mah azat paek ih kami ah na om o ueloe, angaihaih tidoeh om ai ah kho na sah o thai tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Toe nawkamyanawk, oephaih tawn ai kaminawk baktiah, poekhaih tawn ai ah khosah o hmah, palung na set o han ai ah, iip kaminawk ih tamthang thai ai ah ohsak han kang koeh o haih ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jesu loe duek moe, angthawk let boeh, tiah a tang o nahaeloe, to tiah Jesu ah iip kaminawk doeh Sithaw angmah hoi nawnto caeh haih tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Angraeng ih lok rang hoiah nangcae khaeah hae tiah lok kang thuih o, Angraeng angzoh khoek to hing kanghmat aicae mah, iip kaminawk to a caeh o taak mak ai:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Angraeng angmah roe hanghaih lok, kasang koek van kami ih lok, Sithaw ih mongkah lok hoi nawnto van hoiah anghum tathuk tih: to naah Kri ah kadueh kaminawk to angthawk o hmaloe tih:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />to naah aicae kahing kanghmat kaminawk to Angraeng hnuk hanah van ah, nihcae hoi nawnto tamai thungah la tahang tih: to pacoengah loe Angraeng khaeah dungzan ah a om o tih boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />To pongah maeto hoi maeto hae lok hoiah tha angpaek oh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Toe nawkamyanawk, atue hoi aninawk nangcae khaeah ka tarik han angai ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Angraeng ih ni loe aqum ah angzo kamqu baktiah angzo tih, tito kamtueng ah na panoek o boeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nihcae mah misa amdinghaih hoi khosak hoihaih ka tawnh o boeh, tiah thuih o pongah, poek ai pui hoiah zokpomh nongpata nuiah kaom nathaih baktiah nihcae nuiah amrohaih to pha tih, nihcae loe loih o thai mak ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Toe nawkamyanawk, nangcae loe khoving thungah kaom kami ai pongah, hae tiah tamquta hoi kangzo Ani mah na kae o ma kai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nangcae loe aanghaih caa, khodai ih caa ah ni na oh o boih: aicae loe khoving kami na ai ni, aqum ih kami ah doeh a om o ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />To pongah aicae loe minawk baktiah iip o hmah si; hakhaih hoiah zing o si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Iip kaminawk loe khoving ah ni iih o; mu paqui kaminawk doeh khoving ah ni paqui o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Toe aicae loe khodai caa ah a oh o pongah, tanghaih hoi amlunghaih ah kaom saoek padaphaih aphaw to angkhuk o si loe, pahlong hanah oephaih ah kaom lumuek angmuekhaih hoiah pakaa o si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sithaw palungphuihaih aicae nuiah kraih hanah aicae to qoi ai, aicae Angraeng Jesu Kri rang hoiah pahlonghaih a hnuk o han ih ni ang qoih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />aicae a hak o maw, to tih ai boeh loe a iih o maw, Angmah hoi nawnto a hingh o thai hanah, Anih loe aicae zuengah duek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />To pongah vaihi na sak o ih baktih toengah, maeto hoi maeto tha angpaek oh loe, hmacawn hanah maeto hoi maeto angbomh oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nawkamyanawk, nangcae salakah Angraeng toksah kami, nangcae zaehoikung hoi thuitaekkungnawk na pahnet o han ai ah kang pacae o;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />a sak o ih tok pongah amlunghaih hoi khingyahaih to paek oh. Maeto hoi maeto angdaehhaih hoiah khosah oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nawkamyanawk, zaehhoihhaih daan baktiah khosah ai kaminawk to thuitaek oh, poek cak ai kaminawk to thapaek oh loe, thahnaem kaminawk to abomh oh, kami boih nuiah palungsawkhaih na tawnh o thai hanah tha kang paek o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mi khaeah doeh zaehaih to zaehaih baktiah pathok o hmah; nangmacae hoi kaminawk boih salakah kahoih hmuen sak han patom oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Anghoe o poe ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Boeng ai ah lawkthui oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hmuen boih ah kawnhaih lawk to thui oh: hae loe nangcae han Kri Jesu ah Sithaw koehhaih ah oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Muithla to paduek o hmah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lok taphonghaih to patoek o hmah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tih boih tanoek oh loe, kahoih to kacakah tapom oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kahoih ai hmuennawk boih to ayae oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Angdaehhaih Sithaw angmah roe na ciimcai o sak boih nasoe; aicae Angraeng Jesu Kri angzoh naah, nangcae ih muithla, poekhaih palungthin hoi takpum boih coek koi om ai ah suem nasoe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nangcae kawkkung Anih loe oepthoh, sah doeh sah tangtang tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nawkamyanawk, kaicae han lawk na thui pae oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nawkamyanawk boih kaciim mokhaih hoiah ban angsin oh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hae ca hae kaciim nawkamyanawk boih khaeah kroek pae hanah Angraeng ih ahmin hoiah kang pacae o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Aicae Angraeng Jesu Kri tahmenhaih nangcae khaeah om nasoe. Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
